ledTab-sc-2e392861-4 kuoxzu">Exercises in every lesson</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledTab-sc-2e392861-4 gxgXS">Beginner-friendly</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledTab-sc-2e392861-4 gxgXS">Start hacking instantly</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledTab-sc-2e392861-4 gxgXS">Real-world networks</button></div><div class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledMobileSelect-sc-2e392861-5 kydOtq"><div class="styles__StyledDropdownWrapper-sc-737eb9e6-4 gbpbVm"><button type="button" aria-label="click here to choose an option" class="styles__StyledDropdownButton-sc-737eb9e6-0 cUTBVL"><span class="styles__StyledSelected-sc-737eb9e6-6 cuuvFL"></span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down styles__StyledArrowIcon-sc-737eb9e6-5 bZdKJT" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M233.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L256 338.7 86.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div aria-label="Media carousel" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledCarousel-sc-2e392861-6 kdtkdF"><div class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledSlide-sc-2e392861-7 bOkzfm"><div style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledVideoContainer-sc-2e392861-8 eHLhYg"><button aria-label="Play Exercises in every lesson" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPoster-sc-2e392861-11 ebEbMp"><img src="/images/pngs/home/hands-on-video-poster.png" alt="Exercises in every lesson preview." class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledImage-sc-2e392861-10 dMXYJq"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPlayButton-sc-2e392861-12 jxZSDQ"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><title>Play</title><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg></span></button></div><p aria-hidden="false" style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledDescription-sc-2e392861-13 gcYXum">TryHackMe goes beyond textbooks and focuses on fun, interactive lessons that put theory into practice. Access an immersive learning experience with network simulations and intentionally vulnerable technology based on real-world scenarios, plus much more.</p></div><div class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledSlide-sc-2e392861-7 bOkzfm"><div style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledVideoContainer-sc-2e392861-8 eHLhYg"><button aria-label="Play Beginner-friendly" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPoster-sc-2e392861-11 ebEbMp"><img src="/images/pngs/home/hands-on-video-poster.png" alt="Beginner-friendly preview." class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledImage-sc-2e392861-10 dMXYJq"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPlayButton-sc-2e392861-12 jxZSDQ"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><title>Play</title><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg></span></button></div><p aria-hidden="true" style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledDescription-sc-2e392861-13 gcYXum">New to security? No problem! We have learning paths that will teach you the fundamental cyber security skills, which will help set you up to land a job in cyber security.</p></div><div class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledSlide-sc-2e392861-7 bOkzfm"><div style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledVideoContainer-sc-2e392861-8 eHLhYg"><button aria-label="Play Start hacking instantly" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPoster-sc-2e392861-11 ebEbMp"><img src="/images/pngs/home/hands-on-video-poster.png" alt="Start hacking instantly preview." class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledImage-sc-2e392861-10 dMXYJq"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPlayButton-sc-2e392861-12 jxZSDQ"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><title>Play</title><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg></span></button></div><p aria-hidden="true" style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledDescription-sc-2e392861-13 gcYXum">We give you all the tools you need to start learning. Access a machine with the security tools you&#x27;ll need through the browser, and starting learning from anywhere at any time. All you need is an internet connection!</p></div><div class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledSlide-sc-2e392861-7 bOkzfm"><div style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledVideoContainer-sc-2e392861-8 eHLhYg"><button aria-label="Play Real-world networks" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPoster-sc-2e392861-11 ebEbMp"><img src="/images/pngs/home/hands-on-video-poster.png" alt="Real-world networks preview." class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledImage-sc-2e392861-10 dMXYJq"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledPlayButton-sc-2e392861-12 jxZSDQ"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><title>Play</title><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg></span></button></div><p aria-hidden="true" style="translate:0%" class="hands-on-videos-styles__StyledDescription-sc-2e392861-13 gcYXum">Take your cyber security training to the next stage by learning to attack and defend computer networks similar to those used by various organisations today.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if("/$"===d||"/&"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else"$"!==d&&"$?"!==d&&"$~"!==d&&"$!"!==d&&"&"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data="$";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};
$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data="$~",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&("number"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC("B:0","S:0")</script><div hidden id="S:1"><div class="fade-in-section-styles__StyledFadeInSection-sc-a89fd6fa-0 bXCxEY"><section class="community-testimonials-styles__StyledSection-sc-dc101034-1 iYLdys"><div class="container-styles__StyledContainer-sc-11cdba76-0 jXlucY"><header class="community-testimonials-styles__StyledHeader-sc-dc101034-0 GRGtT"><div class="title-styles__StyledTitle-sc-846fb71-0 iEvEAQ"><h2>Community</h2><p data-text="subtitle" class="title-styles__StyledDescription-sc-846fb71-1 bXOlDW">Connect with other like-minded cyber security students and join our huge community. Ask questions, share knowledge and meet people on the same journey as you.</p></div><div class="community-testimonials-styles__StyledUsersContainer-sc-dc101034-2 bBcZGz"><span data-type="users-number">8,000,000</span><span data-type="users-label">Registered Learners</span></div></header><div class="testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledCarouselWrapper-sc-febdb531-1 ijfRjO"><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledWrapper-sc-6c1c86d3-0"><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCarouselOuter-sc-6c1c86d3-1 fcwFVi"><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCarouselViewport-sc-6c1c86d3-2 dAkaXp"><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCarouselTrack-sc-6c1c86d3-3 eqbZRs"><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Tinkerella / @T1nk3r3ll4</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I cannot wait for the day that I can share a great story with you! My plan/goal is to have that story in the next 3 years 🥰 Thank you for providing great experience to those starting out, but especially to those wanting to make a drastic switch part way through their career!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 iHaUwL">T</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Tinkerella</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Sooraj Sathyanarayanan / @iAnonymous3000</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">@RealTryHackMe is one of the best platforms I have come across for learning #cybersecurity. I highly recommend this to anyone who is getting started or even if you are in the intermediate/advanced level. The premium content is so good. Totally worth the subscription. #tryhackme</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">S</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Sooraj Sathyanarayanan</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Brayan Salas / @b_ingtrav</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">This platform is a great place to learn about CyberSec but also to put in practice at the same time. I recently acquired the subscription and now I&#x27;m learning and practice a lot more than before.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 ivsniQ">B</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Brayan Salas</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Rishabh Rai / @rai_rishh</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">It&#x27;s been a year since i have been doing rooms on @RealTryHackMe and yet i learn new things on every new room i do. And it has helped me to start my career in cyber security, and clear eJPT and CEH practical.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">R</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Rishabh Rai</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">THM helped me get my dream job</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">TryHackMe helped me land my dream job. Even though it isn&#x27;t focused purely on DFIR, the platform covers enough rooms to give you a solid grounding in digital forensics processes. For cyber security as a whole, you can find almost everything you need here. Work through the rooms consistently and you&#x27;ll notice a real improvement in your technical skills.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Html Hacker / @devDeels</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I love TryHackMe! Learning cybersecurity can be confusing since there is so much out there but tryhackme is one of the best there is out here! As someone with a non IT background, what I learnt there got me my first internship at a pentesting firm. Keep doing what you&#x27;re doing!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">H</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Html Hacker</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Amazing Platform</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">It&#x27;s been almost a year since I started using TryHackMe and it has genuinely become part of my daily routine. The volume of content and the quality of the learning material are both outstanding. It played a key part in my landing my first role as an Information Security Engineer. I&#x27;d recommend this platform to anyone looking to break into security — the THM team are doing great work.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Love it. Best education experience</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I&#x27;ve only been a member for a few weeks and this is already the most engaging learning experience I&#x27;ve ever had. It&#x27;s genuinely fun and I find myself chipping away at it every single day. I recently stepped back from a master&#x27;s degree in an unrelated field — this kind of practical, hands-on learning is exactly what I was looking for.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Great investment</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">From the start I was given hands-on experience that left me with a real sense of accomplishment. The lessons are well-structured and often include instructional videos to help with the material — it feels like having a guide alongside you. The positive reinforcement built into the platform keeps me motivated to keep going. Put in the effort and you won&#x27;t regret it.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">I&#x27;m a huge fan of TryHackMe</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I started on the free version just to test the waters and was won over very quickly. The rooms and lessons are thorough, well-organised, and genuinely engaging. The in-browser AttackBox is a fantastic feature that lets you practise on real examples without needing your own setup. The content creators clearly know their stuff — TryHackMe is money and time well spent.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Brooda Shah / @BroodaShah</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">One year ago today, I joined TryHackMe and started learning cyber security. I discovered my passion for hacking, met some amazing people and learned a lot. I&#x27;m forever grateful for this amazing platform and all the opportunities it&#x27;s brought my way! 🖤🏆</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 iHaUwL">B</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Brooda Shah</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Been using this platform for about 5...</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I&#x27;ve been using TryHackMe for around five months now and can honestly say it&#x27;s one of the most fun, educational, and engaging platforms I&#x27;ve come across. Whether you&#x27;re brand new to cyber security or just want to keep your skills sharp, I can&#x27;t recommend it highly enough. Keep up the great work!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Chí Hoàng Cao / @chisigma1994</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">TryHackMe is by far is the best platform for learning theoretical knowledge, as well as gaining practical pentest experience from hacking their awesome machines. It is where everything started and it is what makes my joy of hacking still running. Off to complete all the rooms</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 ivsniQ">C</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Chí Hoàng Cao</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Ideal introduction to cyber security tailored for you</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">TryHackMe offers rooms that provide focused lessons and resources to help you progress your cyber security journey. With a personalised learning experience built in, it&#x27;s hard to go wrong wherever you&#x27;re starting from.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">TryHackMe is THE way to learn cybersecurity</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">For beginners looking to start out in cybersecurity, TryHackMe is the place to go. Log in, pick a learning path, launch the tasks and you&#x27;re underway. The challenges strike the right balance — they&#x27;re forgiving enough to learn from, but still genuinely challenging.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Sajid Nawaz Khan / @snkhan</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">My experience has been the same — it was between HTB and THM, and THM won hands down. The learn and try approach works so well, and is offered at such a good price point. Well done to the entire @RealTryHackMe team and the community who makes the platform a success.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 SbswL">S</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Sajid Nawaz Khan</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Vignesh M / @BlueTeamerr</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">This is honestly the best platform out there to learn cyber security. I was an absolute beginner and did not know where to start. Coming across the learning paths on TryHackMe was the best thing that ever happened to me! I have an 84 day streak so far and wish to completee 365!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 DRSfw">V</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Vignesh M</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Anurag Mondal / @7Ragnarok7</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">Have been on the platform for more than 2 years. It has helped me more than any other cybersecurity resources out there and It&#x27;s just pure fun hacking all those rooms and climbing up the ladder one by one ^_^ I love thm ❤️</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 ftsNzJ">A</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anurag Mondal</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Tinkerella / @T1nk3r3ll4</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I cannot wait for the day that I can share a great story with you! My plan/goal is to have that story in the next 3 years 🥰 Thank you for providing great experience to those starting out, but especially to those wanting to make a drastic switch part way through their career!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 iHaUwL">T</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Tinkerella</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Sooraj Sathyanarayanan / @iAnonymous3000</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">@RealTryHackMe is one of the best platforms I have come across for learning #cybersecurity. I highly recommend this to anyone who is getting started or even if you are in the intermediate/advanced level. The premium content is so good. Totally worth the subscription. #tryhackme</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">S</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Sooraj Sathyanarayanan</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Brayan Salas / @b_ingtrav</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">This platform is a great place to learn about CyberSec but also to put in practice at the same time. I recently acquired the subscription and now I&#x27;m learning and practice a lot more than before.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 ivsniQ">B</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Brayan Salas</span></div></div></div></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Rishabh Rai / @rai_rishh</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">It&#x27;s been a year since i have been doing rooms on @RealTryHackMe and yet i learn new things on every new room i do. And it has helped me to start my career in cyber security, and clear eJPT and CEH practical.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">R</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Rishabh Rai</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">THM helped me get my dream job</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">TryHackMe helped me land my dream job. Even though it isn&#x27;t focused purely on DFIR, the platform covers enough rooms to give you a solid grounding in digital forensics processes. For cyber security as a whole, you can find almost everything you need here. Work through the rooms consistently and you&#x27;ll notice a real improvement in your technical skills.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Html Hacker / @devDeels</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I love TryHackMe! Learning cybersecurity can be confusing since there is so much out there but tryhackme is one of the best there is out here! As someone with a non IT background, what I learnt there got me my first internship at a pentesting firm. Keep doing what you&#x27;re doing!</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardAvatar-sc-73567d25-10 izTeDd">H</div><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Html Hacker</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Amazing Platform</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">It&#x27;s been almost a year since I started using TryHackMe and it has genuinely become part of my daily routine. The volume of content and the quality of the learning material are both outstanding. It played a key part in my landing my first role as an Information Security Engineer. I&#x27;d recommend this platform to anyone looking to break into security — the THM team are doing great work.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div><div inert="" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-4 hQSfEw"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.4 512 288.1 391.1 121.7 512l63.5-195.6L18.9 195.6H224.5L288.1 0z"></path></svg></div><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardTitle-sc-73567d25-2 lckvpQ">Love it. Best education experience</p><p class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardQuote-sc-73567d25-6 jKa-DBG">I&#x27;ve only been a member for a few weeks and this is already the most engaging learning experience I&#x27;ve ever had. It&#x27;s genuinely fun and I find myself chipping away at it every single day. I recently stepped back from a master&#x27;s degree in an unrelated field — this kind of practical, hands-on learning is exactly what I was looking for.</p><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardFooter-sc-73567d25-9 fjwQjI"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardInfo-sc-73567d25-11 hSHJqn"><span class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardName-sc-73567d25-12 gkLYKa">Anonymous</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><button aria-label="Previous testimonials" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledNavButton-sc-6c1c86d3-5 bOBnF"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="arrow-left" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-left " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.4 273.4C2.7 268.8 0 262.6 0 256s2.7-12.8 7.4-17.4l176-168c9.6-9.2 24.8-8.8 33.9 .8s8.8 24.8-.8 33.9L83.9 232 424 232c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24L83.9 280 216.6 406.6c9.6 9.2 9.9 24.3 .8 33.9s-24.3 9.9-33.9 .8l-176-168z"></path></svg></button><button aria-label="Next testimonials" class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledNavButton-sc-6c1c86d3-5 hWosTK"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M440.6 273.4c4.7-4.5 7.4-10.8 7.4-17.4s-2.7-12.8-7.4-17.4l-176-168c-9.6-9.2-24.8-8.8-33.9 .8s-8.8 24.8 .8 33.9L364.1 232 24 232c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l340.1 0L231.4 406.6c-9.6 9.2-9.9 24.3-.8 33.9s24.3 9.9 33.9 .8l176-168z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledMobileGrid-sc-6c1c86d3-8 gvnZjt"><div class="infinite-carousel-styles__StyledMobileCardSlot-sc-6c1c86d3-9 chlWAE"><div data-card-variant="standard" class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2BaseCard-sc-73567d25-0 testimonials-carousel-styles__StyledTestimonialCard-sc-febdb531-0 ebRWwV egztas"><div class="v2-testimonial-card-styles__StyledV2CardStars-sc-73567d25-1 iPHRqq"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fass" data-icon="star-sharp" class="svg-inline--fa fa-star-sharp " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M288.1 0l63.5 195.6H557.2L390.9 316.4 454.